@startuml
title SSHSS SysML Internal Block Diagram
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "ibd [Sentinel Security System]" {
  component "sensor: Motion/Entry" as Sensor
  component "camera: Camera" as Camera
  component "panel: Local Panel" as Panel
  component "ccu: Central Control Unit" as CCU
  component "siren: Siren" as Siren
  component "cloud: Cloud Service" as Cloud
  component "app: Mobile Application" as App

  Sensor --> CCU : «itemFlow» SensorEvent, Heartbeat
  CCU --> Sensor : «itemFlow» Config, Challenge
  Camera --> CCU : «itemFlow» Clip, Health
  CCU --> Camera : «itemFlow» RecordRequest
  Panel <--> CCU : «itemFlow» UserCommand, Status
  CCU --> Siren : «itemFlow» AlarmCommand
  Siren --> CCU : «itemFlow» Health, Tamper
  CCU --> Cloud : «itemFlow» Incident, Status, AuditExport
  Cloud --> CCU : «itemFlow» AuthenticatedCommand, Time
  App <--> Cloud : «itemFlow» UserRequest, Alert, View
}

note right of CCU
Authoritative state and local alarm logic.
Durable outbound queue crosses the Internet boundary.
end note
@enduml

